   "updated": 1762560000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "shared code (new:\nhisim.components.shared)\ntypes, enums and pure helpers two\nor more components use:\nHeatingMode,\nSetTemperatureConfig,\nHeatDistributionSystemType, the\nDHW demand config,\nLpgLocalTime, the LPG-car\nhandover types. No behaviour part,\nno component class",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
