   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "config (one group: hisim.config)\nidentity: ComponentID, AddressStep, NameSyntax; declaration API:\nConfigBase, DisplayConfig, @preset, @constructor, sized_field, sizing\nlaws, channels, FactContribution; construction API: presets_of,\nconstructors_of, ConfigBuilder, replace_config, sizing resolution,\nintrospection, report. The yaml does not tell the three apart.",
