   "text": "Stays red: ~50 class imports between components\n(Weather 11, Building 7, HeatingCurveController\n4, ...) for default connections and data reads, + 24\nimportlib calls. They go with\nhisim-default-connection-names-497c (partner\nnamed by string, decided 2026-11-25).",
   "fontSize": 10,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Stays red: ~50 class imports between components\n(Weather 11, Building 7, HeatingCurveController\n4, ...) for default connections and data reads, + 24\nimportlib calls. They go with\nhisim-default-connection-names-497c (partner\nnamed by string, decided 2026-11-25).",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
  },
