  {
   "id": "subtitle",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 52,
   "width": 1507.02,
   "height": 55.2,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 687252606,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 207376334,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1762560000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "origin/main 5c275925e (module_graph.yaml last changed in 48eee86f2, 2026-11-19); generated from the yaml's groups, may_import and registries. Approved by the owner on 2026-11-25 (seams spec, roadmap/hisim_seams_spec.html); the decisions of that day are drawn as decided.\nBlue: a seam, labelled with the interface that crosses it. Grey: an allowed import. Green dashed: data or a call, not an import. Grey dotted: a load by name in a registry.\nEvery box's footer lists the foundation groups it may import (generated from may_import); those arrows are not drawn, except config's. Every group but leaves may also import physics_constants.\nPipeline: YAML -> energy_system builds the system -> simulator runs it -> PostProcessingInput and EconomicsInput -> postprocessing and economics write the result directory.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "origin/main 5c275925e (module_graph.yaml last changed in 48eee86f2, 2026-11-19); generated from the yaml's groups, may_import and registries. Approved by the owner on 2026-11-25 (seams spec, roadmap/hisim_seams_spec.html); the decisions of that day are drawn as decided.\nBlue: a seam, labelled with the interface that crosses it. Grey: an allowed import. Green dashed: data or a call, not an import. Grey dotted: a load by name in a registry.\nEvery box's footer lists the foundation groups it may import (generated from may_import); those arrows are not drawn, except config's. Every group but leaves may also import physics_constants.\nPipeline: YAML -> energy_system builds the system -> simulator runs it -> PostProcessingInput and EconomicsInput -> postprocessing and economics write the result directory.",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
  },
